    "enUS": {
      "description": "So, here's how we're gonna sink those ships. \r\n\r\nI can use that gunpowder you stole and make timed charges. All you've gotta do is hop on each of the Eastsea's boats, and plant one charge in the hull of each. Look for a spot near their cannons, that gunpowder'll make our explosives even more powerful. Once the charges are set, get outta there, and I'll hit the detonator!\r\n\r\nThe elegance of the plan is in its simplicity, don't ya think?",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} First Ship Charge planted",
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Second Ship Charge planted",
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Third Ship Charge planted",
          "type": "object"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Plant a remote explosive charge on each of the Eastsea's three boats.",
      "title": "See Ya, Scallywags!",
